        "original_id": "ecd5f821-807c-51cc-92cf-0b20099dd914",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Little Women (1933 film)\n- People: George Cukor, Katharine Hepburn, Joan Bennett, Frances Dee, Jean Parker, Charles F. Miller, Robert Lowery Hanks\n- Topics: marriages, film debut\n\nFacts:\n- Little Women is a 1933 American pre-Code drama film.\n- George Cukor directed Little Women.\n- Katharine Hepburn, Joan Bennett, Frances Dee, and Jean Parker starred in Little Women.\n- Charles F. Miller made his film debut in Little Women as a minister.\n- Charles F. Miller starred in many films after his debut in Little Women.\n- Jean Parker was married four times.\n- Jean Parker had one son, Robert Lowery Hanks.",
